h/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math><br />So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math>",
